        <mxCell id="repayment.notes.text" value="DERIVED VIEWS (not application entities): v_request_funding = one request; v_installment_balance = one installment;&#10;v_loan_balance = one loan. RQ-04/05 calculate overdue at T. Lender scope uses EXISTS of an own Applied commitment.&#10;BuildRun / BuildStep are operational only (TDD §9). Reconciliation, schedule minimums and oldest-first allocation require transactions." style="shape=text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=18;fontColor=#183247;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
